    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure card time!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786900/extras/0a33f640558f66abd9de2113b7369b9d.avif?t=1707931207\" /></div><br><strong>Collect cards</strong> in your hand and use them to complete quests and defeat enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SANDBOX</h2>In Card Tales you can use cards to get an unexpected result. Apply your <strong>logic, experiment</strong> with new decisions.<br>The story is branched, there is a simplified &quot;legacy&quot; mechanics, your actions affect this game and the following games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use powerful weapons!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786900/extras/a1c030bba698bc465b27342ebd1d601f.avif?t=1707931207\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unlock 3 stories, each with 2 different endings.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Some crazy, dangerous enemies.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Your actions affect the environment!</li></ul>",
